  "notes": [
    "Needs 45 upper-division units, 30 of them CMPT. CMPT 307 and 376W are required; the pick-8 group covers the other 24 CMPT units.",
    "Breadth: complete four courses from four of the six areas in brackets, one of them CMPT 307. Depth: 12 units at the 400 level.",
    "MACM 316 is in the elective pool because several courses need it, but it is not a CMPT course. The BSc credential also wants two Table I, II or III courses (Tables II and III are not included here).",
    "The remaining units are free electives. Confirm everything with an advisor."
